        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...What are you guys doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Awright. Here's the guest of honor himself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey. Welcome to The Ends of the Earth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're late. That's three shots. Guest of honor drinks triple, but you can't drink. So that's nine sodas. Drink up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is it called The Ends of the Earth?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "(And the decor is so gaudy... And what's with the penguin... is this some kind of punk thing...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't just stand there with your tongue hanging out. This is your welcome party! Apple pie?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "So while me and Mostima were out there fighting off mobsters, you were in here partying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... what happened to their leader?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He got away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be more precise, we let him get away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regardless, he got away... so what do we do next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We know the enemy's identity, their goal, and their numbers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're the Siracusan Mafia, and they wanted to take Penguin Logistics's territory in Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "...even though we're a logistics firm and... never mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't sweat it, Texas. We've always got a few days here and there to take out the trash.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd"
    },
    {
        "text": "When ya say it like that, it makes us sound even less like a legitimate business, don't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "They don't know what they're talking about. They couldn't fill the boss's t-shirt for two minutes without cracking under the pressure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Penguin Logistics is a unique operation. And I'm a step even more unique.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that means we have lots of options for how to work this out. Why do we have to fight with them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't know? How have you been...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright, let's not put too much brainpower into this. Find an opportunity to grab their boss, huck him in the river and boom, we're done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "This whole thing has been one big ass waste of time. I just. Don't. Give. A shit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Seriously. This isn't really worth spending any more time on. Here, gum.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Om...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we at least need to come up with a plan to... Wait, what flavor is this gum?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "White Horse Kohl flavor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Croissant, please add this brand of gum to our hazardous materials list.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We were runnin' low so I grabbed the new flavor. Didn't notice what it was. Oops.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yo, are we gonna party or what? We got food, we got drinks, where's the tunes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm on it~!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$bar_intro",
        "key": "$bar_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wasn't expecting jazz... even if it's a little...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "The previous owner was something of a jazz lover, but after the boss took over we had to make a few style changes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "A few?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's pretty much because the boss's own records all got toasted in that\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough. Let's not bring back any tragic memories.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "And besides, nobody asked him to go get sick. Here I am takin' time outta my busy schedule to look after his bar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "is it Oripathy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen's been through a lot. They should've changed the way they look at the Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "He picked up an alcohol allergy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was fixin' to be the greatest bartender in all Lungmen. Fer a feller like that, we call it terminal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
