    },
    {
        "text": "Welp, that's the end of this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Emperor's still out there. Will he be okay?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are these punks still up in my business? Shoot back already, before they completely trash the joint!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, boss, I'm all out of rubber bullets. Should we go at them with the barstools?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did I not buy a forty of malt liquor and leave it here for just such an occasion?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, we just drank the last bottle. All we got left is the top shelf stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Use it. I ain't some stuffy old rich man, filling my palaces with fancy show-off booze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let this liquor show us what it's worth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? But the price on this stuff's higher than\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Grab it, hold it in your hand, and remember: aim for the head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Protecting this bar means protecting my land. Come on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Exusiai.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it! Take a bottle and smash a head. No problem!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "W- wait for me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
